TED_COMMEMORATION_OPTION_GLADIATORS","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[{"tag":"LeaderSubject","values":["SUBJECT_CHARACTER_ARCHETYPE_MARTIAL"]}]},"requirements":[],"text":"You think too abstractly. We will celebrate our triumph with sword and spear!"}],"subjects":["Tribe Dead","Family Us","Family Head Us","City Us","Leader Us","Law Epics"],"text":"Following your recent conquest of the [tribe], an exuberant [character] approaches you with an idea. “Our nation’s might grows daily, my lord. [city]’s finest artists and poets are eager to commemorate our recent triumph over the [tribe]. Let us honor the occasion with a grand festival!”","timing":{"law":"Epics","repeat":"Once per game"},"trigger":"Tribe Eliminated","weight":2},{"author":"Brodie Frehlich","conditions":["Not Scarred"],"guaranteed":[{"text":"+6 Legitimacy"}],"id":"EVENTSTORY_TRIBE_ELIMINATED_THRACIANS_DIEGYLIS","name":"Diegylis","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"+1 Discipline"},{"text":"-2 Courage"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aiRatings: RATING_DISCIPLINE=1, RATING_COURAGE=-2"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_TRIBE_ELIMINATED_THRACIANS_DIEGYLIS_OPTION_EXECUTE_LEADER","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["bKillCharacter 1"],"id":"BONUS_KILL_CHARACTER","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"This man will be executed for his crimes."},{"leadsTo":[{"cat":"follow-ups","id":"EVENTSTORY_TRIBE_ELIMINATED_THRACIANS_DIEGYLIS_DUEL_DRAW","name":"Diegylis' Equal"},{"cat":"follow-ups","id":"EVENTSTORY_TRIBE_ELIMINATED_THRACIANS_DIEGYLIS_DUEL_LOSE","name":"Diegylis' Revenge"},{"cat":"follow-ups","id":"EVENTSTORY_TRIBE_ELIMINATED_THRACIANS_DIEGYLIS_DUEL_WIN","name":"Diegylis' Defeat"}],"linkAdd":"EVENTLINK_DIEGYLIS_DUEL","outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"+1 Courage"},{"text":"Leader relationship: Suspicious Of"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aiRatings: RATING_COURAGE=1"],"id":"BONUS_GAIN_COURAGE_1","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["AddLeaderRelationship RELATIONSHIP_SUSPICIOUS_OF"],"id":"BONUS_LEADER_SUSPICIOUS_OF","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Guards, unbind this man and give him a sword, and bring me mine."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Leader relationship: Vengeful Against"},{"text":"Gain a Court Soldier"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["AddLeaderRelationship RELATIONSHIP_VENGEFUL_AGAINST","aeBonuses: BONUS_MAKE_GREAT_SOLDIER"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_TRIBE_ELIMINATED_THRACIANS_DIEGYLIS_OPTION_RECRUIT_DIEGYLIS","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"There’s no sense in wasting such talent. Let him fight with us, for now."}],"subjects":["Tribe Thracians Dead","Leader Us","Diegylis"],"text":"Following the [tribe]’ last stand, a giant of a man, covered in scars and matted with more blood than could have been his own, is brought before you. The warrior is tightly bound and closely watched by several guards. An officer glances nervously at the [tribe] and takes a step to the side before addressing you. “Your Kingship, this savage chieftain killed five of our warriors before finally being rendered unconscious and bound. Upon awakening, he demanded an audience with you. How shall we deal with him?” The [tribe]’s stony gaze has not wavered since he was brought before you. His words rumble towards you like boulders down a mountain as the earth shakes. “I am Diegylis. Draw blades with me or against me. I care not whether I kill you now or later.”","timing":{"repeat":"Once per game"},"trigger":"Tribe Eliminated","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diegylis","weight":3},{"author":"Brodie Frehlich","conditions":["Ignore No Event Traits"],"guaranteed":[{"text":"+2 Legitimacy"},{"text":"Gain trait: Mourning","tip":["As leader: -10% Orders"],"tipTitle":"Mourning — trait"}],"id":"EVENTSTORY_TRIBE_ELIMINATED_FATAL_OVERSIGHT","name":"Fatal Oversight","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[],"gates":[{"tag":"LeaderSubject","values":["SUBJECT_FOOLISH"]}]},"requirements":[],"t