moke overhead, your soldiers approach. As they draw near, weapons ready, a chorus of battlecries emerges from the hut, followed immediately by several fierce warriors, bloodlust in their wild eyes.","timing":{"minTurns":20,"repeat":"Once per game"},"trigger":"Tribe Eliminated","weight":1},{"author":"Brodie Frehlich","conditions":["Non Leader Us"],"guaranteed":[{"text":"+6 Legitimacy"}],"id":"EVENTSTORY_TRIBE_ELIMINATED_IN_THEIR_PLACE","name":"In Their Place","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["bFreeLaw 1"],"id":"BONUS_FREE_LAW","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Yes, now is the time."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Opinion memory"},{"text":"+1 Discipline"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["Memory MEMORYFAMILY_REFUSED_LAW"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_FAMILY_LAW_NO","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["aiRatings: RATING_DISCIPLINE=1"],"id":"BONUS_GAIN_DISCIPLINE_1","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Still your silver tongue. The laws are not yours to choose."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Opinion memory"},{"text":"+1 Charisma"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["Memory MEMORYFAMILY_REFUSED_LAW"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_FAMILY_LAW_NO","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["aiRatings: RATING_CHARISMA=1"],"id":"BONUS_GAIN_CHARISMA_1","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[{"tag":"LeaderSubject","values":["SUBJECT_CHARACTER_CHARMING"]}]},"requirements":[],"text":"The [tribe] have suffered enough. We will not impose further hardship."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"+2 Legitimacy"},{"text":"Gain trait: Ruthless","tip":["+1 Courage","+40 opinion with same-trait characters"],"tipTitle":"Ruthless — trait"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["iLegitimacy 2","aeAddTraits: TRAIT_RUTHLESS"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_TRIBE_ELIMINATED_IN_THEIR_PLACE_PURGE","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[{"tag":"LeaderSubject","values":["SUBJECT_CHARACTER_TERRIFYING"]}]},"requirements":[],"text":"Slavery is more than the [tribe] deserve. We will purge them from the land."}],"subjects":["Tribe Dead","Family Us","Family Head Us","Player Us","Law Slavery"],"text":"Their lands conquered, the remaining [tribe] people scatter to the four winds. [character], head of the [family] family, approaches you while out on your afternoon walk. “Congratulations, my Lord, on your recent conquest. Our might leaves no room for doubt about our superiority over the [tribe] people.” You continue your walk, [character] shuffling along beside you. “Now is the time to reflect this plain truth in our laws, to put the [tribe] in their place.”","timing":{"law":"Freedom","repeat":"Once per game"},"trigger":"Tribe Eliminated","weight":1},{"author":"Brodie Frehlich","conditions":["Tribe Max Cautious"],"guaranteed":[{"text":"+6 Legitimacy"}],"id":"EVENTSTORY_IRON_AND_ANGUISH","name":"Iron and Anguish","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"-2 Legitimacy"},{"base":-120,"per":-30,"text":"-120 Money (-30/city)","yield":"money"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["iLegitimacy -2","aeBonuses: BONUS_MONEY_LOSS_SMALL"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_IRON_AND_ANGUISH_OPTION_PACIFY_CHARACTER_0","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Tell the [tribe] that we mean them no harm."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Opinion memory"},{"text":"+4 Legitimacy"},{"text":"Gain trait: Steadfast","tip":["As leader: +10% Unit Trait Modifier / Tribal","As general: +25% Unit Trait Modifier / Tribal","+1 Discipline","+20 opinion with same-trait characters"],"tipTitle":"Steadfast — trait"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["bTribeInvade 1","aeBonuses: BONUS_TRIBE_OFFER"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_IRON_AND_ANGUISH_OPTION_INVASION_TRIBE_0","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["iLegitimacy 4","aeBonuses: BONUS_GIVE_TRAIT_STEADFAST"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_IRON_AND_ANGUISH_OPTION_INVASION_CHARACTER_0","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"None shall misread our borders once they’re 