ed and people vanquished, there is little left of [tribe] ways. How shall we honor their legacy?","timing":{"repeat":"Once per game"},"trigger":"Tribe Eliminated","weight":1},{"author":"Josh Unsworth","dlc":"Empires of the Indus","id":"EVENTSTORY_THE_PAIN_OF_CONSCIENCE","name":"The Pain of Conscience","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Gain trait: Pacifist","tip":["As leader: +2 Culture/City"],"tipTitle":"Pacifist — trait"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aeAddTraits: TRAIT_PACIFIST"],"id":"BONUS_GIVE_TRAIT_PACIFIST","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"\"What have I done!?\""},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Gain trait: Bloodthirsty","tip":["As leader: +5% Damaged Them Modifier","As general: +10% Damaged Them Modifier","+1 Courage","+20 opinion with same-trait characters"],"tipTitle":"Bloodthirsty — trait"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aeAddTraits: TRAIT_BLOODTHIRSTY"],"id":"BONUS_GIVE_TRAIT_BLOODTHIRSTY","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["aiTraitProbDelay: TRAIT_CRUEL=25"],"id":"BONUS_MAYBE_CRUEL","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"This is only the beginning."}],"pack":"Empires of the Indus","prob":100,"text":"The war with the [tribe] is over, but at what cost? The faces of the dead and dying haunt you. Your war against the [tribe] has expanded [rival] and brought wealth into [city], funding buildings and statues that stand as a solemn reminder of the devastation left in your wake. As your council discuss future fronts of war, the thought of more death sends chills through you. Is there not another way to rule without such violence and bloodshed?","timing":{"repeat":"Once per game"},"trigger":"Tribe Eliminated","weight":2},{"author":"Brodie Frehlich","guaranteed":[{"text":"+6 Legitimacy"}],"id":"EVENTSTORY_TRIBE_ELIMINATED_WANDERERS","name":"The Wanderers","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"base":-120,"per":-30,"text":"-120 Money (-30/city)","yield":"money"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fie